這封催促回覆（Gentle reminder）的信件建議寫得簡潔有禮即可。你可以參考以下範例直接複製使用：
主旨 (Subject):
RE: FW: 合併案系統留用建構測試 (Gentle Reminder)
內文：
Dear Ling,
Hope this email finds you well.
Just a gentle follow-up regarding the HK historical archive testing in the Shin Kong AML system mentioned below.
Could you please provide an update on the testing status and reply to TK with your test results at your earliest convenience?
Thank you for your assistance.
Best regards,
貫軒 (Mike)
寫作重點提醒：
 * 保持開頭的禮貌（Hope this email finds you well），並清楚點出是針對前一封信的追蹤（follow-up）。
 * 再次明確指出希望對方在完成測試後將結果回覆給 TK（reply to TK with your test results）。





SELECT COUNT(*) AS Diff_Count
FROM Customer_Migrate_buffer a
JOIN BANCS_SK_CUST_INFO b
    ON b.SK_CUST_ID = a.CustomerNo
JOIN BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT c
    ON c.CustomerNo = b.TS_CUST_ID
WHERE b.CUST_RE_NO_FLG IN ('2','3')
  AND b.SK_CUST_ID <> b.TS_CUST_ID
  AND c.CustomerNo <> b.TS_CUST_ID;




SELECT
    a.CustomerNo           AS Source_CustomerNo,
    b.SK_CUST_ID,
    b.TS_CUST_ID,
    b.CUST_RE_NO_FLG,
    c.CustomerNo           AS AML_CustomerNo
FROM Customer_Migrate_buffer a
JOIN BANCS_SK_CUST_INFO b    ON b.SK_CUST_ID = a.CustomerNo
JOIN BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT c    ON c.CustomerNo = b.TS_CUST_ID
WHERE b.CUST_RE_NO_FLG IN ('2','3')  AND b.SK_CUST_ID <> b.TS_CUST_ID;



有沒有辦法看AML_CustomerNo <>TS_CUST_ID 有幾筆?
